{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114877","id":3803351845,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7isosl","number":114877,"title":"Ternary statements switching on types have the wrong inferred type","user":{"login":"sockeye-d","id":106356149,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlbdtQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106356149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d","html_url":"https://github.com/sockeye-d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sockeye-d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-01-12T08:59:03Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T13:34:13Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu, 18 Dec 2025 18:00:18 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (nvidia; 590.48.01) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-12900K (24 threads) - 31.10 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nTernary statements always infer the left-hand type rather than a minimal bound.\n\nFor example:\n\n```gdscript\n(Node2D if is_2d() else Node3D).new() # -> Node\n(Resource if is_res() else Node).new() # -> Object\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWrite this code:\n\n```gdscript\nvar x := (Subtype if randf() < 0.5 else Supertype).new()\n\nclass Supertype:\n\tpass\n\nclass Subtype extends Supertype:\n\tpass\n```\n\nNotice how the inferred type of `x` is `Subtype` rather than `Supertype`, when it should actually be `Supertype` as it is the bound of both types. When swapped to be\n\n```gdscript\nvar x := (Supertype if randf() < 0.5 else Subtype).new()\n```\n\nit switches to `Supertype`.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114877/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}